{"text":"Day nine. You have a fever. The wound is hot. You wrap it in a strip torn from your t-shirt. The entrance let a hunter in. Tomorrow, it has to keep the whole world out. One-handed, you drag stones up from the river and stack them around the opening. Last, a big flat stone. From inside, you can drag it across like a door, and push it aside to get out. When it's closed, it leaves a gap a hand wide. Enough for air. Not enough for teeth. The sun is going down when the door slides into place. Just in time. Two out of three. Twelve dried fish won't last a winter. And you're out of days.","alignment":{"characters":["D","a","y"," ","n","i","n","e","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","h","a","v","e"," ","a"," ","f","e","v","e","r","."," ","T","h","e"," ","w","o","u","n","d"," ","i","s"," ","h","o","t","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","w","r","a","p"," ","i","t"," ","i","n"," ","a"," ","s","t","r","i","p"," ","t","o","r","n"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","t","-","s","h","i","r","t","."," ","T","h","e"," ","e","n","t","r","a","n","c","e"," ","l","e","t"," ","a"," ","h","u","n","t","e","r"," ","i","n","."," ","T","o","m","o","r","r","o","w",","," ","i","t"," ","h","a","s"," ","t","o"," ","k","e","e","p"," ","t","h","e"," ","w","h","o","l","e"," ","w","o","r","l","d"," ","o","u","t","."," ","O","n","e","-","h","a","n","d","e","d",","," ","y","o","u"," ","d","r","a","g"," ","s","t","o","n","e","s"," ","u","p"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r"," ","a","n","d"," ","s","t","a","c","k"," ","t","h","e","m"," ","a","r","o","u","n","d"," ","t","h","e"," ","o","p","e","n","i","n","g","."," ","L","a","s","t",","," ","a"," ","b","i","g"," ","f","l","a","t"," ","s","t","o","n","e","."," ","F","r","o","m"," ","i","n","s","i","d","e",","," ","y","o","u"," ","c","a","n"," ","d","r","a","g"," ","i","t"," ","a","c","r","o","s","s"," ","l","i","k","e"," ","a"," ","d","o","o","r",","," ","a","n","d"," ","p","u","s","h"," ","i","t"," ","a","s","i","d","e"," ","t","o"," "